==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Christmas D.]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Just play it safe, hold the peons off for a bit, and gather up money.  When you're ready, overwhelm the Mooth and Hippoe with your units. The boss, a Blitzen at 20% strength, should appear shortly thereafter. It's really powerful for early game players, so don't underestimate it. You'll want to use tanky units like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]], or strong ranged Cats, like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]].

==Trivia==
*"Reindeer games" is a colloquial expression for activities which exclude outsiders. The term originates from the song "Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer" by [[wikipedia:Johnny Marks|Johnny Marks]]: "All of the other reindeer / Used to laugh and call him names. / They never let poor Rudolph / Join in any reindeer games."

